config BR2_PACKAGE_HEVEA_GATEWAY
	bool "Hevea Gateway"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_HASSIO
	help
	  Install the Hevea Gateway bootstrap service that automatically
	  sets up the Hevea Apps repository and installs the required
	  add-ons (Hevea Gateway, Hevea Access Point, Hevea OpenVPN).

	  This service runs once during first boot and creates a marker
	  file to prevent re-execution on subsequent boots.

	  Also downloads and embeds the Hevea add-on Docker images
	  (gateway, access-point, openvpn) in the HAOS data partition
	  for offline installation, along with a local add-on repository
	  used as a temporary fallback when the device is offline
	  (no internet access to GitHub).

	  https://github.com/hevea-project
